<title>USA: AT&amp;T to make &quot;significant&quot; announcement.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T to make &quot;significant&quot; announcement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T said it will make a &quot;significant announcement&quot; regarding steps it is taking to provide local telephone service to business customers at a news briefing today from 1330 to 1430 EST.</p>
<p>The briefing will be hosted by Jeff Weitzen, AT&amp;T's executive vice president. AT&amp;T for business markets. Weitzen will take questions following his prepared remarks.</p>
</text>
